  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Potential Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/74/Elimona.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201212213913\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Elimona\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/74/Elimona.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201212213913\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/74/Elimona.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201212213913 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/74/Elimona.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201212213913 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Elimona\" width=\"225\" height=\"350\" data-image-key=\"Elimona.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Elimona.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Elimona (Defense Devil)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal the potential of anyone.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>steal the potential of anyone for themselves</b>. Sub-Power of <a href=\"/wiki/Potential_Manipulation\" title=\"Potential Manipulation\">Potential Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Theft\" title=\"Talent Theft\">Talent Theft</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotential_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Usurp Potential</li>\n<li>Potential Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotential_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal the potential of others, whether it be latent abilities or latent aspects and other things about the target. This can remove the potential the other person has and keep it as one's own, and they can go on to unlock that potential at any time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotential_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Assignment\" title=\"Destiny Assignment\">Destiny Assignment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Manipulation\" title=\"Destiny Manipulation\">Destiny Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Divine Power Absorption\">Divine Power Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Borrowing\" title=\"Power Borrowing\">Power Borrowing</a></li>\n<li>Steal <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Potential\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Potential\">Potential</a> from someone.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Title_Bestowal\" title=\"Title Bestowal\">Title Bestowal</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotential_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Authority_Manipulation\" title=\"Authority Manipulation\">Authority Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Theft\" title=\"Existence Theft\">Existence Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fate_Denial\" title=\"Fate Denial\">Fate Denial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inner_Power\" title=\"Inner Power\">Inner Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Purpose_Assignment\" title=\"Purpose Assignment\">Purpose Assignment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Purpose_Manipulation\" title=\"Purpose Manipulation\">Purpose Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Mimicry\" title=\"Total Mimicry\">Total Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Usurp_Worth\" title=\"Usurp Worth\">Usurp Worth</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotential_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot work on users of <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Immunity/Absolute\" title=\"Superpower Immunity/Absolute\">Absolute Superpower Immunity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Immunity\" title=\"Superpower Immunity\">Superpower Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Potential/Absolute\" title=\"Potential/Absolute\">Absolute Potential</a> have too much potential to take or cannot be removed.</li>\n<li>May be temporary.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" 